## Documentation Layout (5-tier)

This product uses a **5-tier doc layout** that separates audience and lifecycle:

| Tier | Folder | Audience | Lifecycle | Owner hat |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | [Product](./01-product/) | End users | Lives across whole product lifetime; grows via Product Deltas | BA / Product |
| 2 | [Business](./02-business/) | BAs, Product Owners | Lives across whole product lifetime; grows via Product Deltas | BA |
| 3 | [Technical](./03-technical/) | Developers | Lives across whole product lifetime; grows via Product Deltas | Tech Lead |
| 4 | [Project](./04-project/) | Internal (agent + dev team) | Per-project (sprints, slices, current work) | Planner / BA / Dev |
| 5 | [Releases](./05-releases/) | All | Append-only per sprint close | Planner |

